  "historyNote": "#4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #5611, eff 4-13-93; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96, EXPIRED: 5-30-04 New. #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
